  "reason": "MATCH is confined to the pinned modern decadal branch projection, including the deliberately stricter explicit-age adapter. The source directly supplies Mệnh first, Cục nominal-age start, sex versus birth-year-branch yin-yang direction, twelve inclusive ten-year ranges and modulo twelve palace indices. Numeric integer1..125 validation and no-placement outside a chart’s Cục..Cục+119 are acceptable explicit adapter restrictions, not assertions of upstream input validation or its childhood fallback behavior. This is no classical formula approval or whole-calendar equivalence claim.",
  "sourceAnalysis": [
    "palace.ts getHoroscope computes soulIndex through getSoulAndBody and uses i=0 at that soulIndex. There is no adjacent anchor or age1 anchor. FiveElementsClass enum is water2,wood3,metal4,earth5,fire6 and constants explicitly say 虚岁. start=Cục+10*i,end=start+9 gives exactly120 eligible integer ages per chart.",
    "GENDER male=阳,female=阴 is compared with yearly earthly branch yinYang, not target-year branch. earthlyBranches alternates 子陽/丑陰 through 亥陰. Equality goes soulIndex+i, inequality soulIndex-i. fixIndex recursively reduces negatives/overflow to0..11; source Dần index0 maps product branch3, source index10 maps product Tí1. Tý/Tí and Tỵ/Tị aliases are explicit, not string equality guesses.",
    "The source loops i<12, so branch wrap at12 does not permit age wrap into13thperiod. FunctionalAstrolabe inclusive lookup independently confirms ends. Its unmatched-decadal childhood fallback is separate; proposed subset omits it, including before-first and after-last. Last valid ages by Cục2..6 are121,122,123,124,125.",
    "getSoulAndBody uses calendar lunar-month/hour inputs and config yearDivide/horoscopeDivide. Both from fields override anchor; getHoroscope chooses from stem/branch independently with nullish fallback for Cục. rearrangeAstrolable is an additional upstream path. These are excluded; a trusted unchanged server natal anchor/Cục is the declared projection input.",
    "kot scans translations with a key hint where supplied and preserves canonical keys; relevant branch,sex,Cục mappings are in the read locale payloads. Modern software provenance identifies a pinned MIT repository object, not an authenticated ancient edition."
  ],
  "calendarAnalysis": [
    "Normal upstream age is target lunar year minus birth lunar year plus1. birthday option adds1 only for later lunar month or strictly later day in same month. Exact lunar birthday does not increment in this code. Fresh reproduction of1990-06-15 birth and1991-07-03/04/05 targets yields normal2/2/2 and birthday1/1/2.",
    "yearDivide defaults normal(lunar new year), optional exact(Lập Xuân); horoscopeDivide affects transit year/month; dayDivide affects late Tí; ageDivide affects date-to-age. None are silently selected by this adapter, whose age is caller supplied.",
    "Product leap-month resolveAnSaoMonth advances at day15; upstream fixLunarMonthIndex advances only day>15 and excludes timeIndex12. This concrete discrepancy prevents full natal equivalence. Reproducing B3 Vietnamese lunar witnesses does not verify upstream lunar-lite/calendar behavior or leap-month birthday semantics."
  ],
  "fixtureAnalysis": [
    "Own fresh script imports only existing product natal conversion/calculation/normalization and independently walks a signed one-based branch ring while incrementing age spans. No iztro code executed; neither packet generator nor replay was executed or used as a formula oracle.",
    "All28 real normalized chart metadata reproduce;336 period tables and existing natal labels agree after independent expected construction;1423 age selections agree;all56 required coverage keys are exercised plus calendar_boundary. Twenty-eight adjacent-anchor and28 reversed-direction counterexamples disagree as required.",
    "Independent strict-age negatives reject undefined,null,string1,true,0,-1,1.5,NaN,Infinity,array,object,126. Fixtures also contain mathematical after-range witnesses above125 (e.g.fire126): those compare finite source intervals only and must be rejected by the public adapter before placement. They do not enlarge the API range.",
    "Invalid profile/gender/chart lists are proposed engineering rejection requirements, not executed product adapter tests or observed upstream rejections. Runtime adapter does not yet exist in this review. Exact majorPeriod keys profile,nominalAge, server metadata integrity and parity guards must be tested when implemented."
  ],
  "classicalAnalysis": "Read committed Quanshu excerpt: 陽男陰女從命前一宮起順行 是父母宮 / 陰男陽女從命後一宮起逆行 是兄弟宮. Its adjacent parent/sibling anchor differs from modern Mệnh. Its committed decision remains INSUFFICIENT_FOR_FORMULA and mayImplement false. Modern documentation attributing its Mệnh paraphrase to Quanshu does not authenticate an edition or resolve that conflict. Existing natal labels use birth-stem parity, equal to birth-branch parity only on consistent sexagenary inputs; all28 actual charts meet this invariant. Labels are compatibility evidence, not historical goldens.",
